{
  "tema": 7247,
  "slug": "estar-fechas-estaciones",
  "titulo": "Estar (not ser) for dates, days and seasons (colloquial)",
  "subtitulo": "Estamos a jueves, estamos en verano.",
  "foto": "t05.jpg",
  "regla": "Colloquially: estamos a + date / day of the week; estamos en + season. Always the nosotros form, in the present.",
  "comparada_kwiziq": "2026-10-10",
  "secciones": [
    {
      "id": "regla",
      "titulo": "The rule",
      "bloques": [
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "In everyday speech, Spanish often uses **estar** to say what the date, the day or the season is. It's used in the present and always in the **nosotros** form: **estamos**."
        },
        {
          "tipo": "tabla",
          "encabezados": [
            "What",
            "Pattern",
            "Example"
          ],
          "filas": [
            [
              "date, day of the week",
              "estamos **a** …",
              "Estamos a cuatro de enero. / Estamos a jueves."
            ],
            [
              "season",
              "estamos **en** …",
              "Estamos en verano."
            ]
          ]
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "With **estamos** you don't need **hoy**: it can only mean today."
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "To ask: **¿A qué día estamos?** or **¿A cuántos estamos?**"
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "The standard way with **ser** also works: **hoy es jueves**, **es verano** (see [[5981|ser for dates]])."
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "Tip: **a** for the calendar, **en** for the season."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "ejemplos",
      "titulo": "Examples",
      "bloques": [
        {
          "tipo": "ejemplos",
          "lista": [
            {
              "es": "Hoy ==estamos a== cuatro de enero.",
              "en": "Today is January 4th."
            },
            {
              "es": "==Estamos a== ocho de marzo de 2026.",
              "en": "It's March 8th, 2026."
            },
            {
              "es": "==Estamos a== jueves.",
              "en": "It's Thursday."
            },
            {
              "es": "—¿==A qué día estamos==? —==Estamos a== martes, dos de mayo.",
              "en": "\"What day is it?\" \"It's Tuesday, May 2nd.\""
            },
            {
              "es": "Ya ==estamos en== verano: ¡a la playa!",
              "en": "It's already summer: to the beach!"
            },
            {
              "es": "¿Por qué traes manga corta? ¡==Estamos en== invierno!",
              "en": "Why are you wearing short sleeves? It's winter!"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
